{"id":"npc:%E6%9F%A5%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E6%9E%97%E5%A5%87","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"维多利亚最后一名成为蒸汽骑士的人，也是在诸王长眠之所的围剿中唯一活下来的最后的蒸汽骑士，此后一直被困于地下，守护着“诸王之息”。在维娜一行人夺走“诸王之息”后，他与阿勒黛·坎伯兰一同重回地表，于伦蒂尼姆战争的银石崖之战中协助典范军，最终在夺回圣王会西部大堂的战斗中牺牲。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情11-19 直指命运、14-10 自光辉中奔涌，活动剧情GO-8 战火重铸之剑等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_651_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/ff/Avg_avg_npc_651_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_651_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act37side/level_act37side_08_end","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":79,"line":80,"speaker":"查尔斯·林奇","text":"（急促的喷气声）"},{"commandIndex":112,"line":113,"speaker":"查尔斯·林奇","text":"（急促的喷气声）"},{"commandIndex":125,"line":126,"speaker":"查尔斯·林奇","text":"（急促的喷气声）"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_st_13-03","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":1587,"line":1588,"speaker":"查尔斯·林奇","text":"……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_14-09_beg","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":737,"line":738,"speaker":"查尔斯·林奇","text":"（沉闷的喷气声）"}]}]}